Error [jet.TypestateWrongState]: `open` needs `Door.Shut`, but `door` is `Door.Locked`
  --> tests/ui/typestate/enum_arm_narrows_to_its_case.jet:21:28
    |
 21 |         .Locked(_) -> door.open()
    |                            ^^^^
 Why: Typestate: `open` takes only `Door.Shut`; calling it with `Door` in another state is the out-of-order bug the state list rules out
 Fix: Bring `door` to `Door.Shut` before calling `open`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0150
